HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_FALKNER:
	.string "Oh, {PLAYER}! Weekends are my day\noff from the GYM.\pI come down to the beach to watch\nthe sea birds ride the wind off\lthe bay. My father used to bring\lme here.\pYou can learn a lot about flying\njust by watching.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_FALKNER:
	.string "FALKNER's out today! On weekends\nhe goes down to the beach at\lCHERRYGROVE CITY to watch\lthe birds.\pHe's back on MONDAY, same\nas always.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_BUGSY:
	.string "Hi, {PLAYER}! Shh… There's a\nSCYTHER molting in that grass!\pI spend my weekends in the\nNATIONAL PARK. The bugs here are\ldifferent on a quiet day.\pI've filled three\nnotebooks already!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_BUGSY:
	.string "BUGSY? On weekends he's at the\nNATIONAL PARK with his notebooks.\pHe'll be back on MONDAY, probably\ncovered in leaves.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_WHITNEY:
	.string "Oh! It's you! What're you doing at\nMOOMOO FARM?\pMe? I help out here every weekend!\nMILTANK just loves the farm, and\lthe milk is SO good.\pDon't tell anyone, but I used to\ncry when I lost. Now I just come\lhere and feel better!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_WHITNEY:
	.string "WHITNEY's at MOOMOO FARM on ROUTE\n39 this weekend. She helps out\lwith the MILTANK.\pCome back on MONDAY if you want\nher here.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_MORTY:
	.string "{PLAYER}… You found me.\pI watch the KIMONO GIRLS dance on\nweekends. Their steps tell old\lstories, if you know how to\lsee them.\pSome of those stories are about\nthe bird of rainbow colors. I'm\lstill learning to read them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_MORTY:
	.string "MORTY's not here. On weekends he\nwatches the KIMONO GIRLS at the\lDANCE THEATER.\pHe says he's studying. He's back\non MONDAY.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_CHUCK:
	.string "WAHAHAH! {PLAYER}! You came all the\nway into MT. MORTAR?\pEvery weekend I train by these\nwaterfalls! My wife says I need a\lday off. THIS is my day off!\pKIYO the KARATE KING trains deeper\nin. One day I'll beat him!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_JASMINE:
	.string "Oh… {PLAYER}. Hello.\pI like the beach on weekends.\nSTEELIX likes the warm sand, and I\lcan still see AMPHY's light\lfrom here.\pEveryone thinks steel is cold. But\nit's warm here in the sun.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_JASMINE:
	.string "JASMINE spends her weekends on the\nbeach on ROUTE 40, just west\lof town.\pShe'll be back on MONDAY. Quiet\nas ever.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_PRYCE:
	.string "Ah, the young one who melted\nmy ice.\pI sit by this pond on weekends. In\nwinter it freezes over, and my old\lfriend and I would skate on it.\pAt my age, a quiet pond is better\ncompany than most.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_PRYCE:
	.string "PRYCE is out by the pond on ROUTE\n44 this weekend. He's been going\lthere for fifty years.\pHe'll be back on MONDAY.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_CLAIR:
	.string "Hmph. {PLAYER}. Don't think\nI'm resting.\pLANCE once found a red GYARADOS in\nthis lake. I come here on weekends\lto see what else it hides.\pA dragon tamer never stops looking\nfor dragons.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_CLAIR:
	.string "CLAIR's at the LAKE OF RAGE this\nweekend. She's hunting for\ldragons. Of course she is.\pShe'll be back on MONDAY, ready\nto battle.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_BROCK:
	.string "Hey, {PLAYER}! Weekends are when I\nhelp out here at the MUSEUM.\pThese fossils are millions of\nyears old, and the team here still\lfinds new ones.\pRocks remember everything. You\njust have to know how to listen\lto them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_BROCK:
	.string "BROCK? He spends his weekends at\nthe PEWTER MUSEUM, staring\lat fossils.\pHe'll be back on MONDAY, solid as\na rock.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_MISTY:
	.string "Oh, it's you! Don't stare, I'm on\nmy day off!\pEvery weekend I swim out to the\nSEAFOAM ISLANDS. It's the best\ltraining there is.\pA GYM pool is nice, but nothing\nbeats the real ocean!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_MISTY:
	.string "MISTY's gone swimming! On weekends\nshe swims out to the SEAFOAM\lISLANDS on ROUTE 20.\pShe'll be back on MONDAY.\nProbably sunburned.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_SURGE:
	.string "Hey, kid! At ease! It's\nthe weekend!\pI come down to the docks to watch\nthe big ships come in. Reminds me\lof my navy days.\pOne of these days I'll ship out\nagain. Just not this weekend!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_SURGE:
	.string "LT. SURGE is down at the VERMILION\ndocks this weekend, watching\lthe ships.\pHe's back on MONDAY, loud as ever.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_ERIKA:
	.string "Oh, hello… I'm sorry, I was\nnearly asleep.\pOn weekends I visit PALLET TOWN.\nThe flowers here grow so freely,\lwith no one to tend them.\pIt's very calming. I may take a\nlittle nap.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_JANINE:
	.string "Fufufu! You spotted me! My\ndisguise needs work.\pI practice my ninja arts out here\non weekends. Hiding in the trees,\lmoving without a sound…\pFather trained me the same way.\nDon't tell him you found me!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_JANINE:
	.string "The real JANINE's not here. On\nweekends she trains on ROUTE 15,\least of town.\pShe'll be back on MONDAY. Or maybe\nshe's here already, in disguise!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_SABRINA:
	.string "…I knew you would come here\ntoday, {PLAYER}.\pOn weekends I sit with MR. FUJI's\nspirits. The POKéMON who rest here\lhave a lot to say.\pTheir voices are quiet. Most\npeople never stop to hear them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_SABRINA:
	.string "SABRINA's not here. She told me\nyou'd ask. On weekends she goes to\lthe SOUL HOUSE in LAVENDER TOWN.\pShe'll be back on MONDAY. She knew\nthat before I did.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_BLAINE:
	.string "Hah! {PLAYER}! Here's a quiz: where\ndoes a fire GYM LEADER go on a\lweekend off?\pAnswer: right back home to\nCINNABAR! The volcano took my GYM,\lbut not my island.\pI sit here, drink my coffee, and\nthink up new riddles!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_BLAINE:
	.string "BLAINE goes home to CINNABAR\nISLAND on weekends. He sits in the\lPOKéMON CENTER there.\pHe'll be back on MONDAY with a\nnew riddle.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_BLUE:
	.string "Hey! What, you think a GYM LEADER\ncan't take a weekend?\pI come out to ROUTE 22 to train.\nThis is the road to the POKéMON\lLEAGUE. I walked it as\lCHAMPION once.\pSomeday I'll walk it again. Smell\nya later!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_BLUE:
	.string "BLUE takes weekends off. He trains\non ROUTE 22, west of town, on the\lway to the LEAGUE.\pHe'll be back on MONDAY.\nBragging, probably.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_ROXANNE:
	.string "Oh! Hello, {PLAYER}. I'm on a field\ntrip of my own today.\pOn weekends I visit the FOSSIL\nMANIAC here on ROUTE 114. He has\ldug up more than any\ltextbook shows!\pA GYM LEADER should never stop\nbeing a student.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_ROXANNE:
	.string "ROXANNE spends her weekends on\nROUTE 114, talking fossils with\lthe FOSSIL MANIAC.\pShe'll be back on MONDAY with\nnew notes.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_BRAWLY:
	.string "Yo, {PLAYER}! Check out\nthese waves!\pDEWFORD's swell is small on\nweekends, so I come over to\lSLATEPORT's beach to ride the\lbig ones.\pGetting knocked down and paddling\nback out. That's how you\lget tough!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_BRAWLY:
	.string "BRAWLY? He's riding the waves at\nSLATEPORT's beach on ROUTE 109\lthis weekend.\pHe'll be back on MONDAY. Probably\nstill dripping.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_WATTSON:
	.string "Wahahahah! Well, if it\nisn't {PLAYER}!\pEvery weekend I come out here to\nwatch the young ones on the\lCYCLING ROAD. All that pedaling\lcould power a city!\pDon't tell anyone, but I've been\nsketching a bike that charges\la battery.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_WATTSON:
	.string "WATTSON's out on ROUTE 110 by the\nCYCLING ROAD. He goes every\lweekend to watch the bikes.\pHe'll be back on MONDAY, laughing\nas loud as ever.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_FLANNERY:
	.string "{PLAYER}! You came all the way up\nMT. CHIMNEY? Wow!\pMy grandfather used to bring me up\nhere on weekends. I still come to\lfeel the heat.\pBeing near the crater reminds me\nwhy I love fire. And why I have to\lkeep it under control!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_FLANNERY:
	.string "FLANNERY goes up MT. CHIMNEY every\nweekend. She says it's where her\lgrandpa trained.\pShe'll be back on MONDAY, all\nfired up.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_NORMAN:
	.string "Ah, {PLAYER}. Caught me on my\nday off.\pOn weekends I come out to fish on\nROUTE 104. MAY always guesses\lthat's where I'll be.\pA fishing line teaches patience.\nSo does raising POKéMON.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_NORMAN:
	.string "NORMAN goes fishing on ROUTE 104\nevery weekend. He says it clears\lhis head.\pHe's back on MONDAY, ready\nfor challengers.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_WINONA:
	.string "Hello, {PLAYER}. Look up. Do you\nsee them?\pOn weekends I come to ROUTE 120 to\nwatch the wild bird POKéMON ride\lthe storm winds.\pEvery flight is different. That's\nwhat makes the sky beautiful.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_WINONA:
	.string "WINONA spends her weekends on\nROUTE 120, watching the birds in\lthe wind.\pShe'll be back on MONDAY.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_TATE_LIZA:
	.string "TATE: Hehehe… We knew you'd come\nhere, {PLAYER}!\pLIZA: Fufufu… On weekends we help\nat the SPACE CENTER. We count the\lrockets together.\pTATE: The scientists say we're the\nonly helpers who never disagree!$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_TATE_LIZA:
	.string "TATE and LIZA are at the SPACE\nCENTER this weekend. They help\lcount the launches.\pThey'll be back on MONDAY. Both of\nthem, at the same time.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Weekend_JUAN:
	.string "Ah, {PLAYER}. What a\npleasant surprise.\pOn weekends I come to LILYCOVE to\nwatch the CONTESTS. Beauty in\lbattle is an art I still study.\pMy student WALLACE taught me a few\nthings here, too. Don't tell him I\lsaid so.$"

HoennSeek_Text_WeekendGuide_JUAN:
	.string "JUAN is at the CONTEST HALL in\nLILYCOVE CITY this weekend. He\lnever misses a show.\pHe'll be back on MONDAY.$"
